00:00:28.720 --> 00:00:30.040
¿Terminaste con tu negocio?

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:31.920
I'm sorry for your loss.

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:32.960
We'll be home soon.

00:00:32.960 --> 00:00:34.600
And you can get some rest.

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:39.680
I don't need to go home.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.200
Just tell me where you want to go

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.040
and I'll take you there.

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:47.920
Do you know where

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:50.160
the Goldis Auction House is?

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:51.960
Yeah.
